      "text": "The crew of the U.S. Coast Guard Cutter Hamilton had a busy week in the Eastern Pacific. \n \nWorking with specialized teams and interagency partners, they stopped two suspected drug smuggling boats, apprehended 8 suspected smugglers, and seized over 12,000 pounds of illicit narcotics. \n \nWorking alongside @Southcom, the Coast Guard is disrupting criminal networks and continuing operations to control, secure, and defend our maritime borders and approaches – where defense of America begins. \n \nBravo Zulu to the whole team! #USCG #druginterdiction\n\n@USCGPACAREA @DHSgov  @jiatfs",
