      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "BREAKING: Acting Coast Guard Commandant Adm. Kevin Lunday & Senior Advisor to the Secretary of the Coast Guard Mr. Sean Plankey just wrapped the second of four campaign-focused town halls on Force Design 2028, providing an overview of the Contracting and Acquisitions campaign during today’s session with our crews. Here's what you need to know. \n \nFD 2028 isn't bureaucratic reshuffling; it's a complete structural overhaul maximizing taxpayer ROI. We're streamlining acquisitions, cutting red tape, and delivering critical assets faster and at lower cost. \n \nBottom line: Our people get the tools they need, when they need them. That's how we serve America better. More on Contracting and Acquisitions under FD 2028: https://t.co/IXudtg9ZCP\n\n#USCG #ForceDesign2028 @DHSgov",
      "text_resolved": "BREAKING: Acting Coast Guard Commandant Adm. Kevin Lunday & Senior Advisor to the Secretary of the Coast Guard Mr. Sean Plankey just wrapped the second of four campaign-focused town halls on Force Design 2028, providing an overview of the Contracting and Acquisitions campaign during today’s session with our crews. Here's what you need to know. \n \nFD 2028 isn't bureaucratic reshuffling; it's a complete structural overhaul maximizing taxpayer ROI. We're streamlining acquisitions, cutting red tape, and delivering critical assets faster and at lower cost. \n \nBottom line: Our people get the tools they need, when they need them. That's how we serve America better. More on Contracting and Acquisitions under FD 2028: https://www.uscg.mil/ForceDesign2028/Contracting-and-Acquisitions/\n\n#USCG #ForceDesign2028 @DHSgov",
