      "text": "Today, we honor the 35th anniversary of the Gulf War and the brave men and women of the U.S. Coast Guard who served with distinction during Operations Desert Shield and Desert Storm. From port security to vessel boarding, their dedication and courage were vital to mission success. We remember their sacrifices and celebrate their legacy. \n \nRead more about the Coast Guard’s role in the Gulf War: https://t.co/3ZadNynfHM \n\n#USCG #AlwaysReady #GulfWar",
